OL,3,GNEWSAPrince William launches #250K fund
OL,4,Afor village
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fund follows William's decision to
OL,7,Fstop personally benefiting from the
OL,8,F#1.5m annual rent generated by Dartmoor
OL,9,FPrison, with the funding redirected
OL,10,Finto the local community.
